  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECTION OF WOMEN FROM DOMESTIC VIOLENCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Promoting women&apos;s right to a life free of violence, through legal advice and counsel project in Peru, implemented by Centro de la Mujer Peruana Flora Trist&#xe1;n, aims to promote improved access to legal services and justice for women affected by gender-based violence in its different forms. The objective of the grant is to provide an advisory and guidance service to women victims of violence to ensure their awareness of relevant institutional mechanisms, their rights, and legal processes.</narrative>
  </description>
